        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keguurei Samuel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiboisiechi lakwanato Samuel Jehovah eng’ taitab Eli. Kima ko tai kegasei ng’olyotab Jehovah eng’ betusiechoto; kima komi ng’ang’utiet ne toogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingoru Eli eng’ oldanyi, (kigatoi kogorio konyekyik, kot ko ma kogeerei kiy,) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ye kitom kome tait ne bo Kamuktaindet, ak koga koru Samuel, eng’ hekalutab Jehovah, ole kimi moingetab Kamuktaindet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koguur Jehovah Samuel: ak kile, Ami yu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilabat ole mi Eli, ak kolenji, Ami yu; amu keguura. Ak kile, Ma aguurse; ru kogeny. Ak kiwa koru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiguur Jehovah kogeny, kole, Samuel. Ak king’eet Samuel kwo ole mi Eli, ak kolenji, Ami yu; amu keguura. Ak kiwolji Eli kolenji, Ma aguurse, werinnyu; ru kogeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitom konai Samuel Jehovah, ak kitom keng’ang’ji inendet ng’olyotab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiguur Jehovah Samuel kogeny ne bo somok. Ak king’eet kwo ole mi Eli, ak kolenji, Ami yu; amu keguura. Ak kinai Eli kole kaguur Jehovah lakwanito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji anyun Eli Samuel, Ui, iru: ak ngot koguurin, imwa ile, Ng’alal, Jehovah; amu kasei otwogindeng’ung’. Kwo anyun Samuel koru eng’ oldanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinyo Jehovah, ak kotonon, koguur ko u tai, kole, Samuel, Samuel. Kile anyun Samuel, Ng’alal; amu kasei otwogindeng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Jehovah Samuel, Keero, ayae kit eng’ Israel, ne ng’wonegitu itik tuwai che bo chito age tugul ne kasei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayachini Eli eng’ betunoto tuguk tugul che kiamwa agobo gonnyi, koboch taunet agoi let. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kiamwachi alenji, Aruokyini gonnyi koigeny, amu tengekto ne kiingen, amu kiipchigei werikyik chubisiet, ama ker kong’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noto anyun kiayosie agobo gotab Eli ale, magitisei tengektab gotab Eli, eng’ tiseiywek anan ko eng’ kagochinoik agoi koigeny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiru Samuel agoi koeech, ak kiyat kurgotikab gotab Jehovah. Ak kiiywei Samuel koborji Eli ng’ang’utionoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiguur Eli Samuel anyun, ak kolenji, Werinnyu, Samuel. Ak kile, Ami yu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile, Nee kit ne komwaun Jehovah? Asomin ale, ameung’ena ng’olyondonoto: ingoyaun ko u noto Kamuktaindet, ak ne siirei noto, ngot iung’ena kiy age tugul eng’ tuguk tugul che komwaun inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwachi Samuel kiy age tugul, ama ung’e kiy inendet. Ak kile Eli, Inendet ko Jehovah: ingoyai ko u ye keerei kole mie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kieet Samuel, ak kimi Jehovah koboto inendet, ama cham kobutyi ng’ony ng’olyo age tugul eng’ ng’alekyik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinai Israel tugul koboch Dan agoi Beer-seba kole kogigimit Samuel koek maotiotab Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitook Jehovah kogeny eng’ Silo: amu king’ang’jigei Jehovah Samuel eng’ Silo eng’ ng’olyotab Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
